--
N5008 [temp.param]/14 + [temp.variadic]/7: a member function template
<class... Args, class Result = ...> called with zero arguments deduces Args
empty; the pack's slot must stay a positional empty marker (so Result is not
shifted into the pack), and the body's forward<Args>(args)... expansion must
be stripped although the pack is not the trailing template parameter.
